hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/fde415c56c2e5b06a5e3e86f0de069a8.avif?t=1772746227\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/0637a92d417f6022a5a0ff0133c72180.avif?t=1772746227\" width=392 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Aquarius, the pirate code is applied to all creatures, from the largest whale to the smallest plankton.<br>Make friends and do business with in numerous Npc's on the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/c82c3d72da6716a6ca01a563beb2465c.avif?t=1772746227\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/18417fc7c49e8dd71322089f05391069.avif?t=1772746227\" width=320 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey you will face numerous enemies with different characteristics and attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/3e266071b0a3e0a5ee67d0de112f9b87.poster.avif?t=1772746227\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/3e266071b0a3e0a5ee67d0de112f9b87.webm?t=1772746227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/